>Released: 2026-08-07</span>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"quote\">\n                    \"#1 Product of the Day on August 7, 2026\" • \"459 upvotes on Product Hunt\"\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"item\">\n                <div class=\"item-title\">\n                    <a href=\"https://developer.meta.com/ai/products/muse-code/\" target=\"_blank\">Meta Muse Code</a>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"item-description\">\n                    Meta's terminal-based coding agent powered by Muse Spark 1.2 model, designed for complex coding workflows including building, debugging, and shipping code.\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                    <span class=\"tag\">AI coding CLI</span>\n                    <span class=\"tag\">Beta</span>\n                    <span class=\"tag\">Released: 2026-08-05</span>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"quote\">\n                    \"21x Cheaper\" • \"82.9% on Terminal-Bench 2.1\" • \"$1.25 per million input tokens\"\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"item\">\n                <div class=\"item-title\">\n                    <a href=\"https://www.browserstack.com\" target=\"_blank\">BrowserStack Test Companion</a>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"item-description\">\n                    An AI coding agent built to speed up test authoring and debugging, capable of running alongside tools like Claude.\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                    <span class=\"tag\">AI debugging tool</span>\n                    <span class=\"tag\">Testing</span>\n                    <span class=\"tag\">Released: 2026-07-29</span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"item\">\n                <div class=\"item-title\">\n                    <a href=\"https://bridgeapp.ai\" target=\"_blank\">BridgeApp</a>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"item-description\">\n                    An AI orchestration layer that connects people, AI agents, tasks, and context in a single workspace to automate the full software development cycle.\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                    <span class=\"tag\">Workflow orchestration</span>\n                    <span class=\"tag\">DevOps</span>\n                    <span class=\"tag\">Released: 2026-07-27</span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- Whitelist Updates Section -->\n        <section class=\"column whitelist-updates\">\n            <h2 class=\"column-header\">📋 Whitelist Updates</h2>\n            <div class=\"empty-state\">\n                No whitelist updates available for this period.\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- Technical Insights Section -->\n        <section class=\"column technical-insights\">\n            <h2 class=\"column-header\">💡 Technical Insights</h2>\n\n            <div class=\"item\">\n                <div class=\"insight-title\">\n                    <a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/\" target=\"_blank\">GitHub Models is now retired</a>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"insight-description\">\n                    GitHub's unified model API has been retired. Willison speculates that coding agent patterns made free tokens prohibitively expensive.\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"insight-meta\">\n                    Simon Willison • 2026-08-09\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                    <span class=\"topic\">github</span>\n                    <span class=\"topic\">llm-pricing</span>\n                    <span class=\"topic\">generative-ai</span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"item\">\n                <div class=\"insight-title\">\n    